{"content": "<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ar" dir="rtl">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<meta name="description" content="عرض تعليمي تفاعلي عن الطبقات الجيولوجية للأرض: القشرة، الوشاح، النواة الخارجية والنواة الداخلية.">
<title>طبقات الأرض الجيولوجية — عرض تفاعلي</title>
<style>
  :root {
    --bg: #070b16;
    --card: #101a30;
    --card2: #0d1628;
    --line: #22304f;
    --hair: #1a2745;
    --ink: #eef3ff;
    --body: #c2cde6;
    --muted: #7f8fb3;
    --accent: #5aa7ff;
    --c-crust: #9c8455;
    --c-mantle: #c24624;
    --c-outer: #f0a13a;
    --c-inner: #f6d47c;
  }
  *, *::before, *::after { box-sizing: border-box; }
  html { scroll-behavior: smooth; }
  body {
    margin: 0;
    font-family: "Segoe UI", "Helvetica Neue", "Noto Kufi Arabic", "Noto Naskh Arabic", Tahoma, Arial, sans-serif;
    color: var(--ink);
    background: var(--bg);
    -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;
    line-height: 1.7;
  }
  ::selection { background: rgba(90, 167, 255, .35); }

  /* ---------- Fixed starfield ---------- */
  .bg-stars {
    position: fixed; inset: 0;
    z-index: 0;
    pointer-events: none;
    opacity: .8;
  }
  .bg-stars i {
    position: absolute;
    background: #fff;
    border-radius: 50%;
    box-shadow: 0 0 5px rgba(255, 255, 255, .45);
    animation: twinkle 3.2s ease-in-out infinite;
  }
  @keyframes twinkle { 0%, 100% { opacity: .25; } 50% { opacity: 1; } }

  /* ---------- Hero ---------- */
  .hero {
    position: relative;
    overflow: hidden;
    text-align: center;
    color: #fff;
    padding: 88px 24px 96px;
    background:
      radial-gradient(1000px 420px at 50% 118%, rgba(255, 150, 70, .16), transparent 62%),
      linear-gradient(180deg, #03050c 0%, #071022 45%, #0d1b3a 80%, #10203f 100%);
  }
  .hero .hero-stars { position: absolute; inset: 0; pointer-events: none; }
  .hero .hero-stars i {
    position: absolute;
    background: #fff;
    border-radius: 50%;
    box-shadow: 0 0 6px rgba(255, 255, 255, .5);
    animation: twinkle 3s ease-in-out infinite;
  }
  .hero h1 {
    position: relative;
    margin: 0;
    font-size: clamp(2.1rem, 5vw, 3.3rem);
    font-weight: 800;
    letter-spacing: -.01em;
    text-shadow: 0 2px 22px rgba(5, 15, 40, .6);
  }
  .hero .sub {
    position: relative;
    margin: 18px auto 0;
    max-width: 720px;
    font-size: 1.05rem;
    color: #c7d4ee;
  }
  .hero .stats {
    position: relative;
    display: flex;
    gap: 10px;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    justify-content: center;
    margin-top: 30px;
  }
  .stat {
    background: rgba(13, 22, 44, .72);
    border: 1px solid var(--line);
    border-radius: 999px;
    padding: 8px 18px;
    font-size: .9rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--body);
    backdrop-filter: blur(6px);
  }
  .stat b { color: #ffd98a; font-weight: 800; }

  /* ---------- Toolbar ---------- */
  .toolbar {
    position: sticky; top: 0; z-index: 50;
    background: rgba(7, 11, 22, .82);
    backdrop-filter: blur(12px);
    -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(12px);
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
  }
  .toolbar .inner {
    max-width: 1240px; margin: 0 auto;
    display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between;
    gap: 12px; flex-wrap: wrap;
    padding: 10px 20px;
  }
  .brand { font-weight: 800; font-size: .95rem; color: var(--ink); }
  .brand span { color: var(--c-inner); }
  .chips { display: flex; gap: 8px; flex-wrap: wrap; }
  .chip {
    display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 6px;
    padding: 7px 13px;
    border-radius: 999px;
    color: var(--body);
    text-decoration: none;
    font-size: .86rem; font-weight: 600;
    border: 1px solid var(--line);
    background: var(--card);
    transition: border-color .2s ease, color .2s ease, background-color .2s ease;
  }
  .chip:hover { border-color: var(--accent); color: var(--accent); }
  .chip.active { background: var(--accent); border-color: var(--accent); color: #04101f; }

  /* ---------- Layout ---------- */
  main {
    max-width: 1240px; margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 36px 20px 40px;
    position: relative; z-index: 1;
  }
  section { scroll-margin-top: 92px; margin-bottom: 34px; }
  .sec-head { margin: 0 0 18px; }
  .kicker {
    display: inline-block;
    font-size: .74rem; font-weight: 800;
    letter-spacing: .12em;
    color: var(--accent);
    background: rgba(90, 167, 255, .12);
    border: 1px solid rgba(90, 167, 255, .25);
    border-radius: 999px;
    padding: 3px 12px;
    margin-bottom: 10px;
  }
  .sec-head h2 { margin: 0; font-size: 1.55rem; font-weight: 800; }
  .sec-head p { margin: 8px 0 0; color: var(--muted); font-size: .95rem; }
  .card {
    background: var(--card);
    border: 1px solid var(--line);
    border-radius: 16px;
    box-shadow: 0 14px 34px rgba(0, 0, 0, .4);
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  /* ---------- Interactive map ---------- */
  .map-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1.5fr) minmax(280px, 1fr);
    gap: 22px;
    padding: 20px;
    align-items: start;
  }
  .diagram-wrap { position: relative; }
  .diagram { width: 100%; height: auto; display: block; }
  .diagram text { font-family: inherit; }
  .diagram .layer { cursor: pointer; }
  .diagram .layer circle { pointer-events: visiblePainted; }
  .diagram .layer:focus { outline: none; }
  .halo { opacity: 0; transition: opacity .25s ease; }
  .halo.on { opacity: .32; }
  #H-inner.halo.on { opacity: .4; }
  .diagram-note {
    margin: 10px 2px 0;
    font-size: .8rem;
    color: var(--muted);
  }
  .panel {
    --pc: var(--c-mantle);
    background: var(--card2);
    border: 1px solid var(--line);
    border-top: 4px solid var(--pc);
    border-radius: 12px;
    padding: 18px;
  }
  .panel-kicker { font-size: .75rem; font-weight: 800; color: var(--muted); letter-spacing: .1em; }
  .panel h3 { margin: 6px 0 12px; font-size: 1.35rem; color: var(--pc); }
  .kv { display: grid; grid-template-columns: auto 1fr; gap: 6px 14px; margin: 0 0 12px; }
  .kv dt { color: var(--muted); font-size: .85rem; }
  .kv dd { margin: 0; font-size: .92rem; font-weight: 600; }
  .panel p { margin: 0; font-size: .92rem; color: var(--body); }
  .lbtns { display: flex; gap: 8px; flex-wrap: wrap; margin-top: 14px; }
  .lbtn {
    border: 1px solid var(--line);
    background: var(--card);
    color: var(--body);
    font: inherit; font-size: .82rem; font-weight: 700;
    padding: 6px 12px;
    border-radius: 999px;
    cursor: pointer;
    transition: all .2s ease;
  }
  .lbtn:hover { border-color: var(--accent); color: var(--accent); }
  .lbtn.active { background: var(--accent); border-color: var(--accent); color: #04101f; }

  /* ---------- Layer cards ---------- */
  .lgrid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr); gap: 16px; }
  .lcard {
    --lc: var(--c-mantle);
    background: var(--card);
    border: 1px solid var(--line);
    border-radius: 14px;
    padding: 16px;
    cursor: pointer;
    transition: transform .18s ease, border-color .18s ease, box-shadow .18s ease;
  }
  .lcard:hover { transform: translateY(-4px); border-color: var(--lc); box-shadow: 0 12px 28px rgba(0, 0, 0, .45); }
  .lcard-top { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 9px; margin-bottom: 10px; }
  .lcard-top .dot { width: 12px; height: 12px; border-radius: 50%; background: var(--lc); box-shadow: 0 0 10px var(--lc); flex: none; }
  .lcard-top h3 { margin: 0; font-size: 1.05rem; }
  .lcard-top .ldepth { margin-right: auto; font-size: .75rem; color: var(--muted); border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: 999px; padding: 2px 9px; }
  .lcard dl { display: grid; grid-template-columns: auto 1fr; gap: 5px 12px; margin: 0 0 10px; }
  .lcard dt { color: var(--muted); font-size: .8rem; }
  .lcard dd { margin: 0; font-size: .88rem; font-weight: 600; }
  .lcard .lnote { margin: 0; font-size: .84rem; color: var(--body); line-height: 1.7; }

  /* ---------- Depth explorer ---------- */
  .depth-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: auto minmax(280px, 1fr);
    gap: 26px;
    padding: 22px;
    align-items: stretch;
  }
  .depthbar {
    position: relative;
    width: 150px;
    height: 430px;
    border-radius: 10px;
    overflow: hidden;
    border: 1px solid var(--line);
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }
  .depthbar .seg { width: 100%; background: var(--c); box-shadow: inset 0 0 22px rgba(0, 0, 0, .4); position: relative; }
  .depthbar .seg i {
    position: absolute; inset: 0;
    display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
    font-size: .78rem; font-style: normal; font-weight: 700;
    color: rgba(255, 255, 255, .92);
    text-shadow: 0 1px 3px rgba(0, 0, 0, .65);
  }
  .depthbar .seg.tiny i { display: none; }
  .depthbar .marker {
    position: absolute; left: -1px; right: -1px;
    border-top: 2px dashed #fff;
    box-shadow: 0 0 8px rgba(255, 255, 255, .5);
    pointer-events: none;
  }
  .depthbar .m-label {
    position: absolute;
    left: calc(100% + 10px); top: -12px;
    white-space: nowrap;
    font-size: .78rem; font-weight: 800;
    color: #fff;
    background: rgba(10, 16, 32, .9);
    border: 1px solid var(--line);
    border-radius: 999px;
    padding: 2px 10px;
  }
  .depth-ui { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 14px; min-width: 0; }
  .slider-row { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; }
  .slider-labels { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; font-size: .8rem; color: var(--muted); font-weight: 600; }
  input[type="range"] {
    width: 100%;
    accent-color: var(--accent);
    height: 28px;
    margin: 0;
    cursor: pointer;
  }
  .readout {
    background: var(--card2);
    border: 1px solid var(--line);
    border-radius: 12px;
    padding: 16px;
  }
  .ro-row { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: baseline; padding: 6px 0; border-bottom: 1px dashed var(--hair); }
  .ro-row:last-of-type { border-bottom: 0; }
  .ro-row span { color: var(--muted); font-size: .85rem; }
  .ro-row strong { font-size: 1rem; font-weight: 800; }
  .gauge { height: 10px; border-radius: 999px; background: #0a1326; border: 1px solid var(--line); overflow: hidden; margin-top: 10px; }
  .gauge i {
    display: block; height: 100%;
    background: linear-gradient(90deg, #3f8fd6, #f0a13a 55%, #ff6b4a);
    transition: width .25s ease;
  }
  .depth-note { font-size: .8rem; color: var(--muted); }

  /* ---------- Processes ---------- */
  .pgrid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); gap: 16px; }
  .ptile {
    background: var(--card);
    border: 1px solid var(--line);
    border-radius: 14px;
    padding: 18px;
    text-align: center;
  }
  .ptile svg { width: 170px; height: 150px; margin: 0 auto 8px; display: block; }
  .ptile h3 { margin: 0 0 6px; font-size: 1.05rem; }
  .ptile p { margin: 0; font-size: .88rem; color: var(--body); }
  .conv-arrow { stroke-dasharray: 26 18; animation: dashflow 1.1s linear infinite; }
  @keyframes dashflow { to { stroke-dashoffset: -44; } }
  .field-line { animation: dashflow 2.2s linear infinite; }
  .wave { transform-origin: 100px 100px; animation: wavepulse 3s ease-out infinite; }
  .wave.w2 { animation-delay: 1s; }
  .wave.w3 { animation-delay: 2s; }
  @keyframes wavepulse {
    0% { transform: scale(.3); opacity: .9; }
    75% { opacity: .3; }
    100% { transform: scale(2.05); opacity: 0; }
  }

  /* ---------- Facts ---------- */
  .fgrid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); gap: 16px; }
  .fact {
    background: var(--card);
    border: 1px solid var(--line);
    border-radius: 14px;
    padding: 16px;
    display: flex;
    gap: 12px;
    align-items: flex-start;
  }
  .fact .emoji { font-size: 1.5rem; line-height: 1.2; flex: none; }
  .fact p { margin: 0; font-size: .9rem; color: var(--body); }
  .fact b { color: var(--ink); }

  footer {
    max-width: 1240px; margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 4px 20px 52px;
    color: var(--muted);
    font-size: .84rem;
    text-align: center;
    line-height: 1.9;
    position: relative; z-index: 1;
  }

  /* ---------- Responsive ---------- */
  @media (max-width: 1000px) {
    .lgrid { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); }
    .map-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    .panel { order: -1; }
  }
  @media (max-width: 760px) {
    .pgrid, .fgrid { grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; }
    .depth-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    .depthbar { height: 340px; }
  }
  @media (max-width: 560px) {
    .lgrid, .pgrid, .fgrid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    .hero { padding: 60px 16px 72px; }
  }

  @media print {
    .toolbar, .bg-stars, .hero .hero-stars { display: none; }
    body { background: #fff; }
  }
  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
    html { scroll-behavior: auto; }
    .bg-stars i, .hero .hero-stars i, .conv-arrow, .field-line { animation: none; }
    .wave { animation: none; opacity: .5; }
  }
</style>
</head>
<body>

<div id="bgStars" class="bg-stars" aria-hidden="true"></div>

<header class="hero">
  <div class="hero-stars" id="heroStars" aria-hidden="true"></div>
  <h1>طبقات الأرض الجيولوجية</h1>
  <p class="sub">رحلة من سطح الكوكب إلى قلبه: القشرة، والوشاح، والنواة — بناءً على ما تكشفه الموجات الزلزالية والاستكشاف العلمي.</p>
  <div class="stats">
    <span class="stat"><b>4</b> طبقات رئيسية</span>
